+# Solution
+
+`redact` uses one compiled, case-insensitive regular expression to identify the three supported API-key prefixes followed by at least 12 ASCII alphanumeric characters. Matching keys are replaced with the literal `***`.
+
+The input is processed line by line while retaining each line ending exactly. If a line's first whitespace-delimited token starts with `DEBUG_`, that complete line is passed through unchanged; all other lines are redacted.
+
+The README contains a notable tension: it first describes masking as unconditional across the entire input, then defines an operational exception for `DEBUG_` logger lines. The implementation follows the more specific exception.
